# Used by BuildKit for workload-generator/Dockerfile. The build context is the repository root, because the
# runner embeds scenarios/, database/common/, and the Incident RCA's capture catalog (rca/capture, rca/history-tables.json):
#   docker build --file workload-generator/Dockerfile .
# Send only what the build needs.
*
!scenarios
!database
!workload-generator
!rca
database/*
!database/common
rca/*
!rca/capture
!rca/history-tables.json
workload-generator/tests
workload-generator/out
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
**/*.md